#. Customer-facing: the button next to WooCommerce's native Add to Cart.
msgid "Customize"
msgstr "Personnaliser"

#. Customer-facing: shown briefly while the design is being handed off to the cart.
msgid "Adding your design to the cart..."
msgstr "Ajout de votre design au panier..."

#. Customer-facing: shown if the WooCommerce add-to-cart AJAX call fails.
msgid "Something went wrong adding your design to the cart. Please try again."
msgstr "Une erreur s'est produite lors de l'ajout de votre design au panier. Veuillez réessayer."

#. Customer-facing: shown if window.open() for the editor tab was blocked.
msgid "Your browser blocked the customizer popup. Please allow popups for this site and try again."
msgstr "Votre navigateur a bloqué la fenêtre du personnalisateur. Autorisez les fenêtres pop-up pour ce site et réessayez."

#. Customer-facing: cart/order line item label for the attached design filename.
msgid "Custom design"
msgstr "Design personnalisé"

#. Customer-facing: cart/order line item label for the design's print dimensions.
msgid "Print size"
msgstr "Taille d'impression"

#. Customer-facing: shown in place of the button if the merchant hasn't configured the plugin yet.
msgid "The OpenMerch editor URL is not configured yet. Set it under WooCommerce > OpenMerch."
msgstr "L'URL de l'éditeur OpenMerch n'est pas encore configurée. Configurez-la dans WooCommerce > OpenMerch."

#. Customer-facing: shown if Customize is clicked before a full variation (size/color/model) is selected.
msgid "Please select all product options above before customizing."
msgstr "Veuillez sélectionner toutes les options du produit avant de personnaliser."
